<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-910322f\" data-id=\"910322f\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8c93037 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"8c93037\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">AUDACES ICF<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3f20304 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3f20304\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Audaces ICF is our 4.0 Cutting Room management system that gives you total control of your production processes in real time. By connecting CAD and CAM software, spreaders, management systems, ERP, and automatic cutting machines, this solution maximizes the efficiency of your entire production cycle while minimizing fabric waste. Trust Audaces ICF with the complete management of your fabric rolls, the characteristics of your models and your garment deadlines, leaving nothing to chance. With an intuitive and user-friendly interface, Audaces ICF allows you to remotely monitor data related to theplanning and management of spreadings and cuttings. Identify machine downtimes and notify any differences from planning to production for optimal management of all your processes.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-86bcb9a elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default wpr-particle